If you want to add channel numbering only and keep everything else unchanged, replace this part inside your render() function:

div.innerHTML=`<div class="badge">LIVE</div>${c.name}`;

with:

div.innerHTML=`<div class="badge">LIVE</div>
<b>${idx + 1}.</b> ${c.name}`;

Or for a cleaner IPTV-style format:

div.innerHTML=`<div class="badge">LIVE</div>
<span style="color:#00d4ff;font-weight:bold">
CH ${String(idx + 1).padStart(4,'0')}
</span>
 - ${c.name}`;

Example output:

LIVE
CH 0001 - ACNN (480p)

LIVE
CH 0002 - Advocate Broadcasting Network (576p)

LIVE
CH 0003 - Africa TV3 (720p)

LIVE
CH 0004 - BCS StarCross TV (576p)

LIVE
CH 0005 - Bride TV (576p)

LIVE
CH 0006 - Caught-Up TV (480p)

LIVE
CH 0007 - Channels 24

LIVE
CH 0008 - Channels TV

LIVE
